	(text "Notes"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.178 259.842 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "523728c6-e55f-5415-9b2d-84fb952dfd06")
	)
	(text "7 · Main power switch (per board, 15 A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.034 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "55531250-b912-47d9-bf84-036e3fc0c93c")
	)
	(text "Servos are OFF unless SERVO_EN is high AND the kill loop (J8) is closed.\nE-stop: one NC contact of a 2-NC button across each board's J8 (bridge JP2 on the bench). R5 (10k) holds Q2 off when the\nGPIO floats or the switch is open. Use a Pi GPIO that defaults to pull-DOWN at boot (GPIO9-27)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "56406c78-8665-5415-8cea-ce9284039ba0")
	)
	(text "J6 = adapter port, pin order D V G.\nPin 2 connects VSERVO through D7 to power the serial bus board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.242 149.606 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "59319aaf-93da-5b85-82b2-5a04383b44fb")
	)
	(text "JP1 (INA226 A0):\nopen = 0x40  left board\nbridged = 0x41  right board"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 51.816 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ad37eb3-54ce-58b4-a803-5bbf9233234e")
	)
	(text "6 · Qwiic I2C (daisy-chain)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 298.45 137.414 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "66fc2887-f23a-4131-bbd7-7c9b00e73f6e")
	)
	(text "3 · Leg outputs ×3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.64 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9339f533-2277-50db-bbc0-2c30927ae7c7")
	)
	(text "Leg connectors = same 3-pin 5264-type as the servos (2.5 mm)\n1 DATA   2 V+ (fused)   3 GND  - straight-through servo cable"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 301.498 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "997f35da-c623-5976-8091-08333ae63e5f")
	)
	(text "• Same PCB for left and right. Right board: bridge JP1 (INA226 -> 0x41).\n• U1 (buck) fitted on both boards. Never tie the two +5V rails together\n   (watch USB VBUS when the Pi and a USB device are powered from different boards).\n• JP3 sets INA226 logic level: 1-2 = 3.3 V host (default), 2-3 = 5 V host.\n• Battery feed: pack -> split to both boards, equal wires. Each board switches itself with Q3 (section 7).\n   One latching switch on J11 of both boards (in parallel) = hard power-off for everything; no soft shutdown.\n• F1-F3: 5 A mini blade - matched to the ~3 A-per-pin servo connectors (brief peaks OK).\n• Check XT30 and adapter-cable pin 1 against your leads before power-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.162 278.892 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "baf838eb-db1a-5412-b2c3-899045c1ce74")
	)
	(text "INA226 logic supply (JP3)\ncap 1-2 = 3.3 V host (default)   cap 2-3 = 5 V host"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.708 178.308 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d273397a-b6e0-4aab-8242-759384a75bf5")
	)
	(text "J9 / J10 are in parallel: chain Pi -> left -> right -> IMU ...\nJP3 must be on 1-2 (3.3 V) when using Qwiic.\nJP5 = on-board 4.7k pull-ups (leave OPEN with a Pi).   \nJP4 = feed Qwiic 3V3 from this board (leave OPEN with a Pi)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.942 147.066 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d3de52ec-d584-476a-b1a8-7fe787ed670c")
	)
	(text "Switch closed (J11 1-2) -> Q3 gate pulled to about -9.9 V -> VBAT_SW on.\nOpen or broken wire -> R18 turns Q3 off: the whole board (buck, Pi, servos) is off.\nOnly ~1 mA flows through the switch, so any small latching switch works.\nQ3 sits before the shunt R1, so the INA226 still measures everything."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 231.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f2c67d0b-7454-40a8-906d-bb0d0c74e3da")
	)
	(text "J7 to host (Pi / ESP32 / Pico / Arduino):  \n1 SDA\n2 SCL\n3 INA ALERT (open-drain)   \n4 SERVO_EN (3.3 or 5 V logic)   \n5 GND\ni2c pullups can be enabled through the I2C_PULL jumper"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 155.702 243.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f52fecf3-4912-5832-816d-8f49d799dfe1")
	)
